--[[
    30 Floors Up - Robscript Team
    Version 1.0 | Info, ESP, Scavenge, Survival

    The game is server-authoritative: every interaction goes through the
    Act RemoteFunction, and the server rejects anything further than about
    nine studs away ("Too far away - step closer to it"). Auto loot
    therefore moves the character next to the item first and only then asks
    the server to pick it up. Hunger, thirst, stamina and the water stores
    are read-only mirrors of the server state; nothing here writes them.
]]

